    <string name="status_app_not_registered_detail_with_fake_suggest"><![CDATA[
Registration is decided and initiated by the application itself, and usually happens automatically when the application starts. Some applications only register on a XiaoMi device; the <b><a href="https://github.com/Magisk-Modules-Repo/MiPushFake">Magisk global-level module</a></b> or the <b><a href="https://github.com/TimothyZhang023/Riru-MiPushFake">Magisk apps-level module</a></b> can improve the odds.
    ]]></string>
