    <string name="status_app_registered_error_title">Abnormal registration</string>
    <string name="status_app_registered_error_desc"><![CDATA[
This usually means the application registered and then unregistered again — turning off push inside the application does that — or that the registration it stored no longer matches the one held by the push service. If you do not need push for this application, or it still receives messages, the warning can be ignored.
    ]]></string>


